# Firebase / Data

MVP is Firebase-first and cost-conscious.

Use:
- Firebase Auth.
- Firestore.
- Firebase Storage.
- Cloud Functions / Cloud Run.
- FCM.
- Remote Config.
- Analytics.
- Crashlytics.

Do not write gameplay state to cloud per Move.

Active Attempt is local-first in Drift.

Server-authoritative:
- Wallet mutations.
- IAP validation.
- entitlements.
- Daily eligibility/rewards.
- privileged Admin writes.

Every economic mutation needs idempotency and duplicate protection.

Offline Coin spend uses pending idempotent transactions and later reconciliation.
